@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000

### Sign in as a Fleet Manager first; the API uses its HttpOnly cookie.
### Replace this request with the configured Development demo password.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "manager@transitops.com",
  "password": "<development-demo-password>"
}

### Download the tenant-scoped fleet ROI PDF (Fleet Manager only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reports/export/pdf/fleet-roi
Accept: application/pdf
